        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Places: Battle Born Studios, Winchester, Nevada, Clark County, Las Vegas Township, Las Vegas Strip, Nevada, United States\n- Organizations: The Killers, Imagine Dragons\n- People: Aja Volkman, Dan Reynolds\n- Products: Hell and Silence, Egyptian\n\nFacts:\n- Winchester is an unincorporated town and census-designated place in Las Vegas Township, Clark County, Nevada, United States, and it contains part of the Las Vegas Strip.\n- Battle Born Studios is a 2000-square-foot recording studio located in Winchester, Nevada.\n- The Killers own Battle Born Studios.\n- Hell and Silence was recorded at Battle Born Studios.\n- Aja Volkman and her husband Dan Reynolds of Imagine Dragons released an EP titled \"Egyptian\" under the moniker Egyptian.",
